# P0-01 type renames (docs/jellyfin/04-architecture.md §4.1). `Old New`, whole words.
#
# Deferred on purpose (not 1:1, target taken, or owned by a later package):
#   PlexServiceError    -> MediaServiceError: its NSError domain "Dusk.PlexServiceError"
#                          is sent in analytics error reports (AnalyticsErrorReport
#                          `nsError.domain`); renaming changes that value. Needs a call.
#   PlexServer, PlexConnection, PlexServerConnection -> P0-16 (ConnectionCandidate exists)
#   PlexUser, PlexHomeUser -> Profile: a merge of two types, P0-16
#   PlexGuid -> ExternalIDs: P0-03
#   PlexTitleEntity(Query): frozen App Intents identifier, P0-18
#   PlexLiveTVDevice(Lineup), PlexLiveTuneResult, PlexLiveChannelMatcher: Plex-private, P0-14
#   PlexService, PlexPin, PlexPinnedSource, PlexManagedHub, *Response, PlexDownloadQueue*,
#   PlexMetadataCache, PlexTransport*: stay Plex or are renamed by their own package

PlexItemID                  MediaItemID
PlexItem                    MediaItem
PlexMediaDetails            MediaDetails
PlexMedia                   MediaVersion
PlexMediaPart               MediaPart
PlexStream                  MediaStream
PlexMarker                  Marker
PlexMediaType               MediaKind
PlexLibrary                 Library
PlexLibraryType             LibraryKind
PlexHub                     HomeRow
PlexEpisode                 Episode
PlexSeason                  Season
PlexAdjacentEpisodes        AdjacentEpisodes
PlexContentKey              ContentKey
PlexRole                    Person
PlexTag                     Tag
PlexRating                  Rating
PlexPlaylist                Playlist
PlexPlaylistEntry           PlaylistEntry
PlexLibraryCollection       MediaCollection
PlexExtra                   Extra
PlexPhotoItem               PhotoItem
PlexSearchResult            SearchSection
PlexLiveTVProvider          LiveTVProvider
PlexLiveChannel             LiveChannel
PlexLiveProgram             LiveProgram
PlexLiveAiring              LiveAiring
PlexLiveChannelGuide        LiveChannelGuide
PlexLiveTVLineup            LiveTVLineup
PlexLivePlaybackContext     LivePlaybackContext
PlexWatchlistEntry          WatchlistEntry
PlexSubtitleSearchResult    SubtitleSearchResult
PlexPlaybackHistoryEntry    PlaybackHistoryEntry

